Based on my review of the G5 DialogueBox mock-up implementation, I can verify the following:

## Implementation Verification

**Scene & Script Files:**
- ✓ `scenes/dialogue/dialogue_box.tscn` exists with proper structure: CanvasLayer (layer 20), portrait TextureRect (96x96, hidden when no portrait), name plate Label, text Label, Choices VBoxContainer, Dim ColorRect, and hint line
- ✓ `scripts/dialogue/dialogue_box.gd` implements all required behaviors

**Core Features:**
- ✓ Portrait display with fallback (hides frame when no portrait declared)
- ✓ Name plate showing current speaker
- ✓ Typewriter effect: CHAR_SECONDS = 0.05 constant, delta-driven reveal via `advance_time(delta)`, tracked in visible_characters
- ✓ Choice buttons: dynamically created via `_maybe_build_choices()`, emits `choice_selected(choice_index, choice)` signal
- ✓ Input pause: swallows advance/interact/cancel via `handles_input()` and `_unhandled_input()`, never touches `get_tree().paused` (preserves co-op other players)
- ✓ Per-player: stamped with `local_peer`, entries selected via `EvalContext.from_profile()`

**StoryManager Wiring:**
- ✓ `start_dialogue()` loads dialogue file, selects entry by local player's flags, shows in box
- ✓ `_on_dialogue_choice()` handles goto (shows next entry) or end (closes box), applies choice set_flags
- ✓ `_on_dialogue_finished()` applies on_end.set_flags when entry finishes

**Documentation:**
- ✓ Code marked as MOCK-UP with design review tag (dialogue_box.gd lines 6-11)
- ✓ Documented in specs/SPEC-story-dialogue.md line 73: "DialogueBox mock-up — week 6, ready for Dev A feedback"

**Tests:**
- ✓ tests/unit/test_dialogue_box.gd contains 14 test cases covering:
  - Show: portrait loading, name plate, text initialization (2 tests)
  - Typewriter: reveal rate, skip behavior, next-line flow (2 tests)
  - Choices: button creation timing, signal emission, no-choice finish (3 tests)
  - Input handling: input swallow while open, cancel closes, input freed after close (3 tests)
  - StoryManager wiring: priority selection, condition evaluation, goto/end choices, on_end flags (4 tests)

**Evidence:**
- ✓ `.goals/evidence/dialogue-box-mockup.png` captured and committed, showing portrait, name, text, choice buttons, hint line, and parchment styling

**Quality Checks:**
- ✓ No Engine.time_scale usage (uses TimeManager-safe _process delta)
- ✓ Tests use named method callbacks, not lambdas
- ✓ No project.godot changes
- ✓ Commits reference PLAN G5 correctly

All success criteria from the BRIEF.md (W6-B2) and PLAN.md (G5) are met.

